      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Each block is a beat: the video follows its prompt for as long as the block lasts, and beats play left to right.\n\nDrag a block to move it. Drag the line after a block to change how long it plays; lengths snap to the model's chunks.\n\nThe line between two beats is how the second one enters: a soft band is a shot, which blends from the beat before; a solid bar is a cut, which starts a fresh scene. Click the line to switch. Models without cuts only blend.\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Each block is a beat: the video follows its prompt for as long as the block lasts, and beats play left to right.\n\nDrag a block to move it. Drag the line after a block to change how long it plays; lengths snap to the model's chunks.\n\nThe line between two beats is how the second one enters: a soft band is a shot, which blends from the beat before; a solid bar is a cut, which starts a fresh scene. Click the line to switch. Models without cuts only blend.\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
